error[trioxide(wasm-ineligible)]: `same` is forced into WASM but can't be compiled: may return one of its array parameters (a returned array must be created by the call)
  --> input.ts:2:10 `same`
      `same` may return one of its array parameters (a returned array must be created by the call)
  help: only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]`, plain-data objects, local control flow, arithmetic, `Math.*` and calls to other compilable functions can be compiled (docs/PLAN.md §5); remove the directive to keep it in JS
